ler, J. Holfort and O. Boebel (1999), Float Observations Showing the Equatorial Crossing of Antarctic Intermediate Water in the Western Pacific, International WOCE Newsletter 34 (March), pp10–14, printed p13. Unpublished manuscript / work-in-progress newsletter report.","source_evidence_kind":"published_original_local_doppler_band_size_constraint","source_locator":"Printed/PDF p13 first column, continuation from p10; article pp10–14. Copyright PDF page 44. Figure 3 cruise-label conflict on p13.","source_quality_note":"Work-in-progress newsletter report, not a peer-reviewed width series. Cruise 113 in prose conflicts with cruise 133 in Figure 3 caption. Salinity sections and float trajectories do not supply width boundaries.","source_retrieved_date":"2026-10-08","source_url":"https://oceanrep.geomar.de/1816/1/news34.pdf","status":"editorial_source_extraction_not_canonical","time_convention":"SONNE cruise 113 context (10 October–19 November 1996); exact Doppler width occupations unresolved. March 1999 is publication, not observation.","uncertainty_km":null,"whole_current_representative":false,"width_metric":"author_reported_current_width","width_range_km":null,"width_rank_eligible":false},{"annual_extrema_eligible":false,"approximate_width_km":40,"boundary_rule":"Attributed author approximate width; no numerical threshold or paired edge coordinates extracted.","calendar_months":null,"current_id":"zeehan","extraction_method":"Approximate width from visually reviewed original paragraph; qualitative section comparison transcribed separately, no velocity-contour digitization.","fixed_layer_bounds_m":null,"full_width_inference_eligible":false,"geographic_scope":"Continental slope at the western entrance of Bass Strait; attributed historical estimate, not all western Tasmanian shelf flow.","id":"zeehan-cresswell-2000-historical-slope-width","is_confidence_interval":false,"layer":"Warm baroclinic slope-current context; fixed width depth bounds unresolved.","measurement_type":"published_regional_summary","name":"Zeehan Current","observed_period":null,"original_regional_context":{"adcp_depth_coverage_is_fixed_width_layer":false,"audit_file":"research/zeehan-cresswell-2000-width-section-scope-audit.json","audit_sha256":"83b7c97d7d30ff2b2044bfc12316d99806b3005da5709afbf385a7f485c1f0c5","boundary_coordinates_extracted":false,"display_caption":"Approximate 40 km historical slope-current width near western Bass Strait, attributed to Baines et al. (1983). Numerical uncertainty and paired edges unknown; not a 1997 Strahan section width.","display_method_note":"Separate 1997 Strahan evidence: December is described as narrower and slightly stronger than March. Neither section has a numerical width here. Two occupations do not establish annual extrema or a monthly climatology; 300 m ADCP coverage is not the historical width layer.","drifter_drogue_is_width_layer":false,"historical_width_is_1997_section_width":false,"method_context":{"december_flow_extends_beyond_adcp_depth_coverage":true,"drifter_drogue_depth_m":15,"is_historical_width_layer":false,"lowest_water_column_fraction_excluded":0.15,"mooring_isobaths_m":[100,200],"ship_adcp_frequency_khz":150,"ship_depth_coverage_m":300},"mooring_isobaths_are_width_layer":false,"original_width_source_access":{"access":"Three-page archived article text readable through web PDF extraction; original bytes not acquired or visually inspected. Publisher download 403; direct archive request 404.","archive_url":"https://citeseerx.ist.psu.edu/document?doi=82056fb29ae09eb8f42aa4b8174a95a3c70b533c&repid=rep1&type=pdf","doi":"10.1071/MF9830155","is_independent_width_record":false,"source_response_sha256":null},"protocol_file":"plans/zeehan-width-source-separation-protocol-v1.md","protocol_sha256":"fadd4e4eff23f524ccdd16aaa6e1f906bb46c9b2bc23dca8cc082c7865f82411","section_comparison":{"annual_range_eligible":false,"comparison_kind":"author_qualitative_between_two_occupations","monthly_climatology_eligible":false,"num