l range; no mapped edges.","display_method_note":"Satellite-image estimate cited in thesis prose; original Aarup images, dates, sensor and edge threshold unreviewed. Mostly mixed-water/bathymetry descriptions do not define image depth. Midsummer widening is qualitative water-mass evidence, not dated numeric satellite widths.","freshwater_definition_is_image_threshold":false,"full_report_reviewed":false,"hydrographic_years_are_image_dates":false,"image_dates_resolved":false,"image_resolution_is_width_uncertainty":false,"image_threshold_resolved":false,"mixed_water_description_is_fixed_depth_slab":false,"naming_context":{"canonical_alias_admitted":false,"naming_audit_file":"research/jutland-current-naming-scope-audit.json","naming_audit_sha256":"4520258deb2ac71bae2269b2c4cf78bf6c47d4c7c20057d68aa08acb89c6d350","north_south_aliases_resolved":false,"norwegian_coastal_width_inheritance_eligible":false},"numeric_seasonal_widths":null,"original_satellite_images_acquired":false,"original_text_language":"Danish","paired_width_boundaries_extracted":false,"protocol_file":"plans/jutland-satellite-width-support-protocol-v1.md","protocol_sha256":"7e509171da27e804a3b1d081d0ec93718a90ea7463025b0146d13bb6b2eca70e","publication_year_is_width_occupation":false,"qualitative_widening_context":{"calendar_months_assigned":null,"coast_distance_sampling_is_paired_width_edges":false,"interpretation":"Author infers widening when German Bight-water fraction peaks become similar at three coast distances; underlying station comparison not shown in this passage.","is_numeric_width_series":false,"is_satellite_width_occupation":false,"site_labels":["Hanstholm","Hirtshals"],"source_locator":"section 7.3.3, printed p63 / PDF p71","source_time_phrase":"midt pa sommeren (midsummer)"},"quantity_scope":"cited_image_width_not_recovered_velocity_core_width","satellite_sensor_resolved":false,"site_label":"Thyboron","sites_form_annual_range":false,"source_access":"unchanged_agency_thesis_selected_pages_reviewed","source_class":"thesis_geographic_synthesis_citing_prior_satellite_images","translation_kind":"OSW_editorial_translation_not_independent_observation","underlying_source_citation":"Aarup, T. (1994a), Satellitbilleder af danske havomrader, Havforskning fra Miljostyrelsen 42. Listed separately from series 52 English thesis in bibliography.","underlying_width_methods_reviewed":false},"phase_kind":"regional_summary","phase_label":"Thyboron cited satellite width","range_interpretation":"One site-specific width description attributed to satellite imagery. Not a dated image diagnosis, paired velocity width, confidence interval, annual extrema or range across sites; no midpoint selected.","range_kind":"reported_typical_regional_width_span","remaining_gates":["Recover Aarup (1994a), Havforskning 42, imagery, sensor, dates and width definition.","Recover compatible layer/time/edge support for comparison to velocity-based sections and DHI water-mass breadth.","Independent scientific/canonical review and resolution of North/South naming."],"seasonal_playback_eligible":false,"section_geometry":null,"section_orientation":"Reported satellite-image current breadth at a named coastal site; no flow-normal transect orientation recovered.","source_citation":"Nielsen, Mads Hvid (2000), Dynamisk beskrivelse og hydrografisk klassifikation af Den Jyske Kyststrom, DMI Scientific Report 00-15, ISBN 87-7478-425-0. Reprint of April 1999 University of Copenhagen master thesis; reprint preface October 2000.","source_evidence_kind":"original_thesis_regional_summary_citing_satellite_estimate","source_locator":"Section 2.4 / 2.4.1, printed p14 / PDF p22; mixed-water context printed p15 / PDF p23; qualitative widening printed p63 / PDF p71; references printed p132 / PDF p140; reprint preface PDF p3.","source_quality_note":"Inspected original thesis cites Aarup (1994a) for image widths. Sensor, image dates, threshold, uncertainty and paired edges unresolved. Hydrographic and wind analyses are sep