ption convention; not a complete observed trajectory from the 2014-2016 glider surveys.\",\r\n  \"source_url\": \"https://essd.copernicus.org/articles/11/147/2019/\",\r\n  \"source_locator\": \"Cotroneo et al. (2019), section 1: after leaving the Alboran Sea, Atlantic Water flows eastward along the Algerian coast in an along-slope Algerian Current; the study surveys the Algerian Basin, not the complete named-current axis.\",\r\n  \"source_citation\": \"Cotroneo et al. (2019), Glider data collected during the Algerian Basin Circulation Unmanned Survey, Earth System Science Data 11, 147-161, doi:10.5194/essd-11-147-2019.\",\r\n  \"coordinate_selection\": \"OSW chooses coarse offshore regional gates at -1.5/0 E and 7/8 E and intervening waypoints. No exact start/end longitude is asserted by the source; these conventions delimit the Algerian coastal route for comparison.\",\r\n  \"coordinates_lon_lat\": [\r\n    [\r\n      -1.5,\r\n      36\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      0,\r\n      36.35\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      2,\r\n      37\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      4,\r\n      37.3\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      6,\r\n      37.4\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      8,\r\n      37.3\r\n    ]\r\n  ],\r\n  \"alternative_routes\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"later_western_gate\",\r\n      \"coordinates_lon_lat\": [\r\n        [\r\n          0,\r\n          36.35\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          2,\r\n          37\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          4,\r\n          37.3\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          6,\r\n          37.4\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          8,\r\n          37.3\r\n        ]\r\n      ],\r\n      \"interpretation\": \"Later western regional gate at 0 E.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"earlier_eastern_gate\",\r\n      \"coordinates_lon_lat\": [\r\n        [\r\n          -1.5,\r\n          36\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          0,\r\n          36.35\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          2,\r\n          37\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          4,\r\n          37.3\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          6,\r\n          37.4\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          7,\r\n          37.5\r\n        ]\r\n      ],\r\n      \"interpretation\": \"Earlier eastern regional gate at 7 E.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"both_inner_gates\",\r\n      \"coordinates_lon_lat\": [\r\n        [\r\n          0,\r\n          36.35\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          2,\r\n          37\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          4,\r\n          37.3\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          6,\r\n          37.4\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          7,\r\n          37.5\r\n        ]\r\n      ],\r\n      \"interpretation\": \"Both inner regional gates; no physical current absence outside them implied.\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"scenario_rule\": \"Four regional start/end conventions crossed with three whole-route longitude offsets and independent endpoint latitude offsets of -0.1/0/+0.1 degrees: 108 editorial scenarios; not empirical uncertainty.\",\r\n  \"map_view_box\": [\r\n    780,\r\n    260,\r\n    70,\r\n    60\r\n  ],\r\n  \"endpoint_labels\": [\r\n    \"Alboran transition\",\r\n    \"Eastern Algeria gate\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"figure_source_label\": \"Cotroneo et al. (2019)\",\r\n  \"route_extent_kind\": \"Algerian coastal regional route\",\r\n  \"input_sha256\": \"ebb5e41d4d143cdc0833f844e88318a0dbe13773d7272abe9c449813a0818b9d\",\r\n  \"generator_file\": \"analysis/build_current_reference_path_candidate.py\",\r\n  \"generator_sha256\": \"1362693ec7075e014d065691923248db455a5c3cd78c9a94880b3b472594d240\",\r\n  \"method\": \"Sum shortest WGS84 geodesic distances between successive OSW editorial vertices; no velocity field or current core is reconstructed.\",\r\n  \"nominal_reference_path_km\": 869.055,\r\n  \"reported_approximate_reference_path_km\": 900,\r\n  \"scenario_range_km\": [\r\n    635.648,\r\n    873.753\r\n  ],\r\n  \"reported_scenario_range_km\": [\r\n    600,\r\n    900\r\n  ],\r\n  \"scenario_count\": 108,