egional geography paraphrased with attribution; no source figures, curves or velocity data packaged.\",\r\n  \"longitude_offsets_degrees\": [\r\n    -0.05,\r\n    0,\r\n    0.05\r\n  ],\r\n  \"endpoint_latitude_offsets_degrees\": [\r\n    -0.05,\r\n    0,\r\n    0.05\r\n  ],\r\n  \"report_rounding_km\": 100,\r\n  \"rank_eligible_published_estimates\": false,\r\n  \"candidate_comparison_group\": \"osw_approximate_reference_routes\",\r\n  \"whole_system_length\": false,\r\n  \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-03\",\r\n  \"map_label_size\": 2.6,\r\n  \"legend_line_spacing\": 4.8,\r\n  \"map_symbol_scale\": 0.9,\r\n  \"remaining_gates\": [\r\n    \"Review Grand Banks branching and offshore eastern approach naming gates before length admission.\",\r\n    \"Validate intermediate jet corridor, bathymetry and finer geography using suitable velocity fields; no measured axis extracted.\",\r\n    \"Keep countercurrent and southward recirculation branches separate; neither widths nor branch lengths transferred.\",\r\n    \"Obtain consistent dated geometry and width boundaries before seasonal playback or annual length/width ranges.\",\r\n    \"Canonical admission and publication review.\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"schema\": \"osw.current-reference-path-input.v1\",\r\n  \"current_id\": \"azores\",\r\n  \"name\": \"Azores Current\",\r\n  \"scope\": \"OSW reference corridor from a Grand Banks branch-region gate near 40 N / 45 W, southeast to the Mid-Atlantic Ridge near 34 N / 37 W, then eastward toward an offshore Gulf of Cadiz approach gate. Excludes upstream Gulf Stream, North Atlantic branch, Azores Countercurrent, southern recirculation, southward branches into the North Equatorial/Canary routes and Gibraltar/Mediterranean inflow. No whole connected-system length.\",\r\n  \"layer\": \"Surface-intensified eastward subtropical-jet naming context. Source long-term core analysis averages upper 1000 m; 2009 section samples deeper flow separately. No fixed-depth current axis or uniform full-width footprint reconstructed.\",\r\n  \"time_convention\": \"Regional geography from Frazao et al. (2022), with 1993-1994 drifter and October-November 2009 section caveats. Selected vertices are neither the 1871-2010 model mean axis nor dated seasonal trajectories.\",\r\n  \"source_url\": \"https://www.frontiersin.org/journals/marine-science/articles/10.3389/fmars.2022.842251/full\",\r\n  \"source_locator\": \"Introduction, paragraphs beginning The Azores Current originates and East of the Mid-Atlantic Ridge: Grand Banks origin, MAR crossing, eastward jet and distinct recirculation/branches.\",\r\n  \"source_citation\": \"Frazao et al. (2022), The Forgotten Azores Current: A Long-Term Perspective, Frontiers in Marine Science 9, 842251, doi:10.3389/fmars.2022.842251.\",\r\n  \"supporting_sources\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"url\": \"https://agupubs.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1029/2000JC000345\",\r\n      \"citation\": \"Martins et al. (2002), Surface circulation in the eastern North Atlantic, from drifters and altimetry, doi:10.1029/2000JC000345.\",\r\n      \"locator\": \"Section 3.3.2 and Figure 3: 34-36 N eastward flow toward Gulf of Cadiz; seasonal position/width inference inconclusive.\",\r\n      \"role\": \"Eastern regional continuation; no drifter axis digitized.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"url\": \"https://accedacris.ulpgc.es/bitstream/10553/52759/1/azores_current_system_from.pdf\",\r\n      \"citation\": \"Comas-Rodriguez et al. (2011), The Azores Current System from a meridional section at 24.5 W, JGR Oceans 116, C09021, doi:10.1029/2011JC007129.\",\r\n      \"locator\": \"Abstract and section 2: 2009 meridional survey; 110 km widths and separate eastward/westward currents.\",\r\n      \"role\": \"Section context only; width is not along-current length and is not applied along the route.\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"coordinate_selection\": \"All vertices are OSW-selected. Source names approximate Grand Banks and MAR regional locations; offshore Gulf of Cadiz gate and intermediate longitude/latitude bends are editorial. Alternative departure/approach gates and a slightly northern eastward corridor test convention, not observed seasonal variation. No source arrows, front, reanalysis axis or drifter tracks digitized.\",\r\n  \"coordinates_lon_lat\": [\r\n    [\r\n      -45,\r\n      40\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      -42,\r\n      37\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      -37,\r\n      34\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      -32,\r\n      34\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      -28,\r\n      34\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      -24.5,\r\n      33.75\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      -20,\r\n      34\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      -16,\r\n      34.3\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      -12,\r\n      34.8\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      -9.2,\r\n      35.5\r\n    ]\r\n  ],\r\n  \"alternative_routes\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"shorter_origin_eastern_approach\",\r\n      \"coordinates_lon_lat\": [\r\n        [\r\n          -44,\r\n          39.5\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -42,\r\n          37\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -37,\r\n          34\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -32,\r\n          34\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -28,\r\n          34\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -24.5,\r\n          33.75\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -20,\r\n          34\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -16,\r\n          34.3\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -12,\r\n          34.8\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -10,\r\n          35\r\n        ]\r\n      ],\r\n      \"interpretation\": \"Shorter selected origin and offshore eastern gate convention; not seasonal contraction.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"northern_origin_corridor\",\r\n      \"coordinates_lon_lat\": [\r\n        [\r\n          -46,\r\n          40.5\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -42,\r\n          37.5\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -37,\r\n          34.5\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -32,\r\n          34.5\r\n     