vertices and alternatives. Excludes Wyrtki surface jets, westward undercurrent conventions, anomalous fall episodes and whole-basin endpoints.\",\r\n  \"layer\": \"Upper-thermocline eastward undercurrent geography. No uniform fixed depth reconstructed; 80.5 E, 50-150 m observations in 1994 are a different local occupation, not this route layer.\",\r\n  \"time_convention\": \"Spring eastward convention. Review reports several observations between 53 E and 91 E during March-April 1963; those stations do not establish a simultaneous continuous axis or annual recurrence.\",\r\n  \"source_url\": \"https://www.whoi.edu/cms/files/schott_mccreary_41948.pdf#page=29\",\r\n  \"source_locator\": \"Schott and McCreary (2001), section3.2.1 printed/PDF29: eastward spring observations at several positions 53-91 E in March-April 1963; displacement and transient structure. Sections 3.2.1-3.2.2 pp29-31 distinguish moorings, years and models. Cited pages reviewed, not source axis digitization.\",\r\n  \"source_citation\": \"Schott and McCreary (2001), The monsoon circulation of the Indian Ocean, Progress in Oceanography 51, 1-123, doi:10.1016/S0079-6611(01)00083-0.\",\r\n  \"source_license\": \"Elsevier original retained locally; independent attributed geographic annotations only. No source figures/fields reproduced.\",\r\n  \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-13\",\r\n  \"coordinate_selection\": \"Source supports the declared regional geography or study-domain convention. OSW selects all gates, rounded connecting vertices and alternative bends; no velocity axis or source trajectory reconstructed. Independent longitude and endpoint-latitude shifts describe drawing choices, not current width, source position errors or seasonal extrema.\",\r\n  \"coordinates_lon_lat\": [\r\n    [\r\n      53,\r\n      0\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      63,\r\n      0\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      73,\r\n      0\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      83,\r\n      0\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      91,\r\n      0\r\n    ]\r\n  ],\r\n  \"alternative_routes\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"southern_bend\",\r\n      \"coordinates_lon_lat\": [\r\n        [\r\n          53,\r\n          0\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          63,\r\n          -0.5\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          73,\r\n          -0.5\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          83,\r\n          -0.5\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          91,\r\n          0\r\n        ]\r\n      ],\r\n      \"interpretation\": \"Alternative editorial bend between the declared regional gates; not a measured seasonal state.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"northern_bend\",\r\n      \"coordinates_lon_lat\": [\r\n        [\r\n          53,\r\n          0\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          63,\r\n          0.5\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          73,\r\n          0.5\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          83,\r\n          0.5\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          91,\r\n          0\r\n        ]\r\n      ],\r\n      \"interpretation\": \"Alternative editorial bend between the declared regional gates; not a measured seasonal state.\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"longitude_offsets_degrees\": [\r\n    -0.25,\r\n    0,\r\n    0.25\r\n  ],\r\n  \"endpoint_latitude_offsets_degrees\": [\r\n    -0.5,\r\n    0,\r\n    0.5\r\n  ],\r\n  \"scenario_rule\": \"Three declared shapes with three longitude shifts and independent three-value endpoint latitude shifts: 81 retained editorial scenarios, not statistical uncertainty or annual variation.\",\r\n  \"report_rounding_km\": 100,\r\n  \"rank_eligible_published_estimates\": false,\r\n  \"candidate_comparison_group\": \"osw_studied_reach_routes\",\r\n  \"whole_system_length\": false,\r\n  \"remaining_gates\": [\r\n    \"Independently validate component/naming,layer,gates,fine coastline and bathymetry before physical admission.\",\r\n    \"Acquire compatible dated velocity geometry before measuring a current axis or seasonal dimensions.\",\r\n    \"Do not sum component reaches or transfer neighboring current/channel widths.\",\r\n    \"Whole-current dimensions,annual ranges,occupied width polygons,physical state containment and NASA identity remain unresolved.\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"map_view_box\": [\r\n    990,\r\n    405,\r\n    205,\r\n    135\r\n  ],\r\n  \"map_label_size\": 2.7,\r\n  \"legend_line_spacing\": 4.32,\r\n  \"map_symbol_scale\": 0.65,\r\n  \"endpoint_labels\": [\r\n    \"53 E OSW gate\",\r\n    \"91 E OSW gate\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"figure_source_label\": \"Schott/McCreary (2001), sec 3.2.1\",\r\n  \"route_extent_kind\": \"spring observational-domain reference reach\",\r\n  \"source_coordinate_typo_not_used\": \"Separate Swallow1964 passage prints67.5 N; this is not repaired or used as a route gate.\",\r\n  \"source_observation_months\": [\r\n    3,\r\n    4\r\n  ],\r\n  \"source_observation_year\": 1963,\r\n  \"supports_annual_route_geometry\": false,\r\n  \"source_review_receipt\": {\r\n    \"source_document_file\": \"research/source-data/schott-mccreary-2001/journal-article.pdf\",\r\n    \"source_document_sha256\": \"6d85965c19dac54ee808603299afc9fb752193cc75d2efb76f2df06768f7f95e\",\r\n    \"acquisition_file\": \"research/source-data/schott-mccreary-2001/acquisition.json\",\r\n    \"acquisition_sha256\": \"cacc0331c4cc7fefde5476e94b6b672c89a77c8d563e71e65bccff313e4b8f33\",\r\n    \"audit_file\": \"research/indian-euc-spring-observation-reach-scope-audit.json\",\r\n    \"audit_sha256\": \"2713da5c61cc459c370020423ac27b653ede99093a6f520cb908c0d6e60c211b\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"input_sha256\": \"306a87f0bc705e3c4b8937ab0b4d1a2f094858bd83a3389a98eb4eaee2600bf5\",\r\n  \"generator_file\": \"analysis/build_current_reference_path_candidate.py\",\r\n  \"generator_sha256\": \"1362693ec7075e014d065691923248db455a5c3cd78c9a94880b3b472594d240\",\r\n  \"method\": \"Sum shortest WGS84 geodesic distances between successive OSW editorial vertices; no velocity field or current core is reconstructed.\",\r\n  \"nominal_reference_path_km\": 4230.141,\r\n  \"reported_approximate