ry retained scenario, with tile ID as deterministic tie-break. No physical identification asserted.\",\r\n  \"input_file\": \"research/kuroshio-extension-reference-path-input.json\",\r\n  \"figure\": \"figures/kuroshio-extension-reference-path-candidate.svg\"\r\n}\r\n","source_sha256":"0d776be891ec1cdcff094e51c10117deb5f55da3229a03b6c125e8c52f7ad96e"},"research/labrador-reference-path-candidate.json":{"source_json":"{\r\n  \"status\": \"editorial_reference_path_candidate_not_scientifically_reviewed\",\r\n  \"geometry_role\": \"osw_editorial_reference_route\",\r\n  \"crs\": \"OGC:CRS84\",\r\n  \"source_license\": \"Factual regional geography paraphrased with attribution; no source figure, drawn arrow or observational array packaged.\",\r\n  \"longitude_offsets_degrees\": [\r\n    -0.25,\r\n    0,\r\n    0.25\r\n  ],\r\n  \"endpoint_latitude_offsets_degrees\": [\r\n    -0.25,\r\n    0,\r\n    0.25\r\n  ],\r\n  \"report_rounding_km\": 100,\r\n  \"rank_eligible_published_estimates\": false,\r\n  \"candidate_comparison_group\": \"osw_approximate_reference_routes\",\r\n  \"whole_system_length\": false,\r\n  \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-02\",\r\n  \"map_label_size\": 1.8,\r\n  \"legend_line_spacing\": 3,\r\n  \"map_symbol_scale\": 0.65,\r\n  \"remaining_gates\": [\r\n    \"Scientific review of regional naming extent, branch exclusions and endpoint conventions.\",\r\n    \"Compare offshore editorial vertices with reproducible bathymetry and suitable layer-specific current geometry.\",\r\n    \"Canonical admission and publication review; no uniform full-system length inferred.\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"schema\": \"osw.current-reference-path-input.v1\",\r\n  \"current_id\": \"labrador\",\r\n  \"name\": \"Labrador Current\",\r\n  \"scope\": \"Main offshore Labrador regional branch from an OSW southern Davis Strait gate at 60 N, along Labrador and east Newfoundland, via the western Flemish Pass region to an OSW tail-of-Grand-Banks gate at 43 N. Excludes upstream Baffin/West Greenland feeder paths, Hudson Strait intrusion, inshore Avalon branch, offshore eddy excursions and downstream westward/eastward branches. Source defines regions, not exact gates or a whole-system termination.\",\r\n  \"layer\": \"Regional upper-ocean offshore branch geography; no fixed-depth, velocity-derived core or deep western boundary axis.\",\r\n  \"time_convention\": \"Regional naming convention from a 1984 government synthesis; not a simultaneous observation, dated model field or assertion of constant current strength.\",\r\n  \"source_url\": \"https://waves-vagues.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/Library/40621704.pdf\",\r\n  \"source_locator\": \"Hildebrand, Oceanographic Setting, Currents, printed page 11 (PDF index 12): southern Davis Strait origin, Labrador coastal flow, inshore/offshore distinction, western Flemish Pass and tail of Grand Banks. Figure 2 arrows encode velocity classes, not measured path lengths.\",\r\n  \"source_citation\": \"Hildebrand (1984), Oceanographic Setting, in Wilson and Addison (eds.), Health of the Northwest Atlantic, Canadian government report, pp. 8-30.\",\r\n  \"coordinate_selection\": \"OSW chooses every offshore waypoint and exact 60 N/43 N gates. Alternatives vary regional latitude endpoints. Source arrow lengths are velocity classes and are not digitized as current lengths. Shelf-break and Flemish Pass correspondence require finer verification.\",\r\n  \"coordinates_lon_lat\": [\r\n    [\r\n      -59,\r\n      60\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      -57.5,\r\n      58\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      -55,\r\n      55\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      -52,\r\n      52\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      -50,\r\n      50\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      -48.5,\r\n      48.5\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      -47.7,\r\n      47\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      -48.8,\r\n      45\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      -50,\r\n      43\r\n    ]\r\n  ],\r\n  \"alternative_routes\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"inner_regional_gates\",\r\n      \"coordinates_lon_lat\": [\r\n        [\r\n          -58.3,\r\n          59\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -57.5,\r\n          58\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -55,\r\n          55\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -52,\r\n          52\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -50,\r\n          50\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -48.5,\r\n          48.5\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -47.7,\r\n          47\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -48.8,\r\n          45\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -49.5,\r\n          44\r\n        ]\r\n      ],\r\n      \"interpretation\": \"Shorter OSW Davis/tail approach convention; exact limits are editorial.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"outer_regional_gates\",\r\n      \"coordinates_lon_lat\": [\r\n        [\r\n          -59.5,\r\n          61\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -59,\r\n          60\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -57.5,\r\n          58\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -55,\r\n          55\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -52,\r\n          52\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -50,\r\n          50\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -48.5,\r\n          48.5\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -47.7,\r\n          47\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -48.8,\r\n          45\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -50,\r\n          43\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -50.5,\r\n          42.5\r\n        ]\r\n      ],\r\n      \"interpretation\": \"Broader OSW Davis/tail approach convention; does not trace downstream branches.\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"scenario_rule\": \"Three regional endpoint conventions crossed with whole-route longitude and independent endpoint latitude shifts of -0.25/0/+0.25 degrees: 81 editorial scenarios, not empirical uncertainty.\",\r\n  \"map_view_box\": [\r\n    510,\r\n    140,\r\n    130,\r\n    160\r\n  ],\r\n  \"endpoint_labels\": [\r\n    \"Southern Davis gate\",\r\n    \"Grand Banks tail gate\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"figure_source_label\