deterministic tie-break. No physical identification asserted.\",\r\n  \"input_file\": \"research/mindanao-reference-path-input.json\",\r\n  \"figure\": \"figures/mindanao-reference-path-candidate.svg\"\r\n}\r\n","source_sha256":"4048ff257d547b9810a6198f8ed91561029d2897175af94cb7e533e7d915afe8"},"research/monsoon-summer-sri-lanka-reference-path-candidate.json":{"source_json":"{\r\n  \"schema\": \"osw.current-reference-path-input.v1\",\r\n  \"current_id\": \"monsoon\",\r\n  \"name\": \"Monsoon Current\",\r\n  \"status\": \"editorial_reference_path_candidate_not_scientifically_reviewed\",\r\n  \"geometry_role\": \"osw_editorial_reference_route\",\r\n  \"crs\": \"OGC:CRS84\",\r\n  \"scope\": \"Declared 77–83 E Sri Lanka regional summer reach, oriented eastward. Gates and connecting vertices are selected by OSW; neither gate is a physical whole-current endpoint. Excludes Arabian Sea source branches, Laccadive circulation, Bay of Bengal continuation, equatorial jets and subsurface counterflows. Different seasonal drawings do not diagnose occupied footprints or annual extrema.\",\r\n  \"layer\": \"Seasonal near-surface regional geography. Historical section evidence is shallow and depth dependent; no fixed-depth velocity axis reconstructed and undercurrents excluded.\",\r\n  \"time_convention\": \"Boreal summer source convention, June–September. Historical review and section context, not a simultaneous dated trajectory or current-year climatology.\",\r\n  \"source_url\": \"https://www.whoi.edu/cms/files/schott_mccreary_41948.pdf\",\r\n  \"source_locator\": \"Schott and McCreary (2001), section 5.1.5, printed pp. 63–65 / PDF indices 62–64: seasonal directions/months, Sri Lanka bottleneck and separate upper-layer/undercurrent flows. August 1993 and January 1991 sections provide local latitude context, not regional axis vertices.\",\r\n  \"source_citation\": \"Schott and McCreary (2001), The monsoon circulation of the Indian Ocean, Progress in Oceanography 51, 1–123, doi:10.1016/S0079-6611(01)00083-0.\",\r\n  \"source_license\": \"Factual geography paraphrased with attribution; no source figures, curves or velocity fields reproduced.\",\r\n  \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-03\",\r\n  \"coordinate_selection\": \"77 E and 83 E are held editorial regional gates spanning the Sri Lanka passage. Nominal 4 N crossing at 80.5 E follows the described August 1993 local core as orientation only; remaining vertices and northeastward bend are editorial. Alternative mid-route latitude shifts and independent endpoint latitude offsets test drawing choices, not observations or annual extrema.\",\r\n  \"coordinates_lon_lat\": [\r\n    [\r\n      77,\r\n      4\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      78.5,\r\n      4\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      80.5,\r\n      4\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      82,\r\n      4.5\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      83,\r\n      6\r\n    ]\r\n  ],\r\n  \"alternative_routes\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"southern_drawing\",\r\n      \"coordinates_lon_lat\": [\r\n        [\r\n          77,\r\n          4\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          78.5,\r\n          3.5\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          80.5,\r\n          3.5\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          82,\r\n          4.0\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          83,\r\n          6\r\n        ]\r\n      ],\r\n      \"interpretation\": \"Editorial middle-vertex latitude shift; not a current edge or another month.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"northern_drawing\",\r\n      \"coordinates_lon_lat\": [\r\n        [\r\n          77,\r\n          4\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          78.5,\r\n          4.5\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          80.5,\r\n          4.5\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          82,\r\n          5.0\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          83,\r\n          6\r\n        ]\r\n      ],\r\n      \"interpretation\": \"Editorial middle-vertex latitude shift; not a current edge or another month.\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"longitude_offsets_degrees\": [\r\n    0\r\n  ],\r\n  \"endpoint_latitude_offsets_degrees\": [\r\n    -0.25,\r\n    0,\r\n    0.25\r\n  ],\r\n  \"scenario_rule\": \"Three declared shapes with fixed longitude gates and independent start/end latitude offsets -0.25/0/+0.25 degrees: 27 editorial cases. Not seasonal minima/maxima, uncertainty or width bounds.\",\r\n  \"report_rounding_km\": 100,\r\n  \"rank_eligible_published_estimates\": false,\r\n  \"candidate_comparison_group\": \"osw_studied_reach_routes\",\r\n  \"whole_system_length\": false,\r\n  \"remaining_gates\": [\r\n    \"Review the regional gate/axis choices against compatible seasonal velocity fields.\",\r\n    \"Separate surface flow, near-coastal counterflow, equatorial jets and undercurrents.\",\r\n    \"Resolve upstream and downstream branches before a whole-current estimate.\",\r\n    \"Recover matching seasonal transverse boundaries and repeated comparable observations before annual dimensions.\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"map_view_box\": [\r\n    1075,\r\n    355,\r\n    135,\r\n    130\r\n  ],\r\n  \"map_label_size\": 3.7,\r\n  \"legend_line_spacing\": 5.6,\r\n  \"map_symbol_scale\": 0.7,\r\n  \"endpoint_labels\": [\r\n    \"77 E gate\",\r\n    \"83 E gate\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"figure_source_label\": \"Schott/McCreary 2001\",\r\n  \"route_extent_kind\": \"summer regional reach\",\r\n  \"context_landmarks\": [],\r\n  \"source_season_convention\": {\r\n    \"label_basis\": \"boreal\",\r\n    \"role\": \"source_observation_labels_only\",\r\n    \"months_by_label\": {\r\n      \"summer\": [\r\n        6,\r\n        7,\r\n        8,\r\n        9\r\n      ]\r\n    },\r\n    \"source_locator\": \"Section 5.1.5, printed p. 63: June–September eastward SMC; November–February westward NMC.\",\r\n    \"supports_annual_route_geometry\": false\r\n  },\r\n  \"input_sha256\": \"b254ecbc25358b9668b55dee5c14eb8cbd8ecc9eef57c2f038a7c65ec3bb2c0c\",\r\n  \"generator_file\": \"analysis/build_current_reference_path_candidate.py\",\r\n  \"generator_sha256\": \"1362693ec7075