 verified current axis, bathymetric contour and dated geometry beyond the regional P1-P2-S1 connection.\",\n    \"existing_scope\": \"Geodesic connection through three author-provided NwASC reference points. Connecting legs are an OSW editorial construction; source nominal positions are not independently measured current-core endpoints. Regional source-reference span, distinct from the broad historical3500km reported extent. No500m bathymetric contour or velocity axis reconstructed.\",\n    \"planning_status\": \"editorial_planning_crosswalk_not_scientific_classification_approval\",\n    \"name_source_url\": \"https://os.copernicus.org/articles/22/17/2026/\",\n    \"existing_length_evidence_status\": \"published_estimate\",\n    \"ledger_kind\": \"current\",\n    \"planning_basis\": \"Three source-provided reference coordinates support a regional editorial geodesic connection.\",\n    \"strategy_next_action\": \"Keep the source anchors fixed; recover independent current geometry before any whole-current or seasonal-axis claim.\",\n    \"known_component_currents\": [],\n    \"component_inventory_status\": \"parent_and_downstream_name_boundaries_retained\"\n  },\n  \"method_source\": {\n    \"id\": \"source:nwasc-source-anchor-route-v1\",\n    \"kind\": \"internal\",\n    \"label\": \"OSW NwASC source-anchor regional reference protocol v1\",\n    \"url\": \"../plans/nwasc-source-anchor-route-protocol-v1.md\",\n    \"repository_path\": \"plans/nwasc-source-anchor-route-protocol-v1.md\",\n    \"path\": \"plans/nwasc-source-anchor-route-protocol-v1.md\",\n    \"used_in_collections\": [\n      \"reference_routes\",\n      \"route_decisions\",\n      \"objects\"\n    ],\n    \"material_use_class\": \"internal_calculation_method\",\n    \"provider_asset_redistributed\": false\n  },\n  \"bend_sensitivity_is_uncertainty\": false,\n  \"source_coordinate_uncertainty_km\": null,\n  \"whole_current_length_km\": null,\n  \"annual_length_range_km\": null\n}\n","source_sha256":"4721