19487.\",\r\n          \"locator\": \"Section 1 paragraphs describing Lanzarote Passage intermediate flow and naming iPUC/CiPU.\",\r\n          \"supports\": \"Explicit separately named layer-dependent northward current; no borrowed Canary route length or numerical width admitted. Full article accessed 2026-10-03.\"\r\n        }\r\n      ],\r\n      \"remaining_gates\": [\r\n        \"Review iPUC/CiPU alias convention and physical distinctions from upper-layer recirculation and other regional poleward undercurrents.\",\r\n        \"Establish layer, upstream/downstream naming boundaries and suitable geometry before measuring extent.\",\r\n        \"Integrate reviewed identity, sources, taxonomy, state joins and navigation through canonical admission gates.\"\r\n      ]\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"proposed_id\": \"svalbard-branch\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Svalbard Branch\",\r\n      \"basin\": \"Fram Strait / northern Svalbard\",\r\n      \"proposed_kind\": \"named Atlantic-water current branch\",\r\n      \"identity_scope\": \"Shallow shelf-edge branch north-west of Svalbard; source-specific usage of WSC core and Svalbard branch requires review.\",\r\n      \"inventory_decision\": \"missing_from_current_name_ledger\",\r\n      \"length_decision\": \"resolve_branch_origin_rejoin_layer_and_time_gates\",\r\n      \"whole_current_length_km\": null,\r\n      \"rank_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"evidence\": [\r\n        {\r\n          \"url\": \"https://agupubs.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1029/2018JC014299\",\r\n          \"citation\": \"Menze et al. (2019), Atlantic Water Pathways Along the North-Western Svalbard Shelf Mapped Using Vessel-Mounted Current Profilers, doi:10.1029/2018JC014299.\",\r\n          \"locator\": \"Abstract, section 4.3 and Figure 6; summer 2014-2017 observational composite.\",\r\n          \"supports\": \"Explicit named pathway; composite does not establish continuous presence. No branch geometry or width extracted.\"\r\n        }\r\n      ],\r\