ervations, 1995-1999, Deep-Sea Research I 48, 937-957, doi:10.1016/S0967-0637(00)00038-8.\",\r\n          \"source_locator\": \"Publisher-indexed abstract, eastern and western branch width statements.\",\r\n          \"source_access\": \"Publisher-indexed abstract inspected. Full original 2001 article and figures remain unreviewed.\",\r\n          \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-08\",\r\n          \"sampling_context\": {\r\n            \"mooring_context_months\": {\r\n              \"start\": \"1995-04\",\r\n              \"end\": \"1999-02\"\r\n            },\r\n            \"mooring_context_is_width_sampling_interval\": false,\r\n            \"mooring_bathymetry_m\": [\r\n              490,\r\n              990\r\n            ],\r\n            \"bathymetry_is_width_layer\": false,\r\n            \"reported_jet_depth_m\": 400,\r\n            \"jet_depth_is_width_layer\": false\r\n          },\r\n          \"temporal_interpretation\": \"Mooring program dates are context, not a dated width series. No annual or seasonal range established.\",\r\n          \"unit\": \"km\",\r\n          \"full_width_inference_eligible\": false,\r\n          \"source_publication_year\": 2001\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n          \"id\": \"norwegian-atlantic-front-bosse-2019-corrected-width\",\r\n          \"proposed_current_id\": \"norwegian-atlantic-front\",\r\n          \"name\": \"Norwegian Atlantic Front Current\",\r\n          \"status\": \"editorial_width_evidence_for_proposed_identity_not_canonical\",\r\n          \"source_current_label\": \"NwAFC / Polar Front\",\r\n          \"measurement_type\": \"published_corrected_glider_front_width_summary\",\r\n          \"width_metric\": \"positive_poleward_depth_averaged_gaussian_integration_span\",\r\n          \"approximate_width_km\": 38,\r\n          \"width_range_km\": null,\r\n          \"author_reported_error_km\": 2,\r\n          \"error_interpretation\": \"Reported plus/minus statistic; width-specific interpretation awaits corrected supporting Table S1. Adjacent velocity statistics use standard errors. No annual range or confidence level assigned.\",\r\n          \"range_kind\": null,\r\n          \"is_confidence_interval\": false,\r\n          \"geographic_scope\": \"Mohn Ridge Polar Front, not the Svinoy section or whole branch.\",\r\n          \"layer\": \"Depth-averaged absolute geostrophic jet, constrained by glider depth-average currents from upper-1000-m profiling; no fixed-depth width slab.\",\r\n          \"boundary_rule\": \"Fit a Gaussian to depth-averaged velocities above half peak; positive poleward integration boundaries within maximum plus/minus two fitted sigma. Theoretical transport coverage is not confidence coverage or FWHM.\",\r\n          \"observed_period\": null,\r\n          \"calendar_months\": null,\r\n          \"fixed_layer_bounds_m\": null,\r\n          \"section_geometry\": null,\r\n          \"whole_current_representative\": false,\r\n          \"rank_eligible\": false,\r\n          \"annual_extrema_eligible\": false,\r\n          \"seasonal_playback_eligible\": false,\r\n          \"full_width_inference_eligible\": false,\r\n          \"source_url\": \"https://agupubs.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1029/2019GL084723\",\r\n          \"source_citation\": \"Bosse and Fer (2019), Mean Structure and Seasonality of the Norwegian Atlantic Front Current Along the Mohn Ridge From Repeated Glider Transects, doi:10.1029/2019GL084723; corrected 2020-09-28.\",\r\n          \"source_locator\": \"Corrected publisher HTML: sections 2.2-2.4, 3.1-3.2 and erratum.\",\r\n          \"source_access\": \"Corrected publisher text reviewed. Corrected original PDF and supporting Table S1 not acquired; raw-mission source QA is not paper reproduction.\",\r\n          \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-13\",\r\n          \"source_correction_date\": \"2020-09-28\",\r\n          \"source_publication_year\": 2019,\r\n          \"sampling_context\": {\r\n            \"glider_contex