ndian Ocean\",\r\n      \"proposed_kind\": \"poleward western boundary current\",\r\n      \"identity_scope\": \"Southward East Madagascar Current along southeast Madagascar. This proposal resolves the southern branch explicitly; it does not include the northward branch, underlying equatorward East Madagascar Undercurrent, offshore South Indian Ocean Countercurrent, or downstream eddies.\",\r\n      \"inventory_decision\": \"missing_from_current_name_ledger\",\r\n      \"length_decision\": \"published_southern_branch_extent_captured_pending_identity_admission\",\r\n      \"whole_current_length_km\": null,\r\n      \"current_width_km\": null,\r\n      \"rank_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"evidence\": [\r\n        {\r\n          \"url\": \"https://agupubs.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1029/2007JC004639\",\r\n          \"citation\": \"Nauw, van Aken, Webb, Lutjeharms and de Ruijter (2008), Observations of the southern East Madagascar Current and undercurrent and countercurrent system, JGR113, C08006, doi:10.1029/2007JC004639.\",\r\n          \"locator\": \"Introduction paragraph2; Results3.1 paragraph17; abstract.\",\r\n          \"supports\": \"Distinct named southward current; approximate650km branch extent and approximate120km near-surface survey width have separate spatial and temporal supports.\",\r\n          \"source_access\": \"Publisher full HTML inspected2026-10-21. Direct publisher PDF/epdf returned403; no original PDF checksum or full visual figure review claimed.\"\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n          \"url\": \"https://research-portal.uu.nl/en/publications/observations-of-the-southern-east-madagascar-current-and-undercur/\",\r\n          \"citation\": \"Utrecht University publication record for Nauw et al. (2008).\",\r\n          \"locator\": \"Abstract and bibliographic record.\",\r\n          \"supports\": \"Institutional record confirms study identity and the survey width; it is the same study, not independent numerical corroboration.\"\r\n    