vey-width\",\r\n            \"dimension\": \"width\",\r\n            \"value_km\": 120,\r\n            \"approximate\": true,\r\n            \"metric\": \"author_reported_near_surface_survey_width\",\r\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results3.1 paragraph17; abstract\",\r\n            \"support\": \"SectionsT5–T8 in April2001 off southeast Madagascar. Near-surface current structure uses VMADCP mean velocity in the upper100m. Numeric edge cutoff, boundary coordinates and width uncertainty are not specified in this passage.\",\r\n            \"observed_period\": \"2001-04\",\r\n            \"fixed_layer_bounds_m\": null,\r\n            \"velocity_averaging_layer_m\": [\r\n              0,\r\n              100\r\n            ],\r\n            \"velocity_averaging_layer_is_verified_width_layer\": false,\r\n            \"endpoint_coordinates_lon_lat\": null,\r\n            \"uncertainty_km\": null,\r\n            \"is_annual_mean\": false,\r\n            \"is_annual_extremum\": false,\r\n            \"rank_eligible\": false\r\n          }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"interpretation\": \"Separate source-reported dimensions, not the sides of a current footprint. April2001 width and contextual branch length must not be multiplied into an area. No seasonal range, dated axis, fixed width layer or annual mean inferred.\"\r\n      },\r\n      \"remaining_gates\": [\r\n        \"Review southern branch identity and naming against northern branch, undercurrent and countercurrent before canonical admission.\",\r\n        \"Acquire original PDF and visually review source figures; retain the distinction between primary survey width and cited contextual length.\",\r\n        \"Recover explicit velocity boundaries and repeat occupations before annual width or seasonal map construction.\",\r\n        \"Integrate reviewed identity into canonical names, taxonomy, release, atlas and source-backed state joins; no Agulhas geometry inherited.\"\r\n      ]\r\n    }\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n","source_sha