urrent identification or dated event matching. Fraction measures equirectangular display line, not physical kilometres.\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"nasa_tiles_sha256\": \"52c6605c32e59f50aa4abde984489c7055c0e3e201e7323e30160a623c9666e0\",\r\n  \"recommended_nasa_tile_id\": \"level2_G_3\",\r\n  \"nasa_crop_recommendation_rule\": \"Highest zoom crop covering the entire display route in every retained scenario, with tile ID as deterministic tie-break. No physical identification asserted.\",\r\n  \"input_file\": \"research/pacific-neuc-northern-reach-reference-path-input.json\",\r\n  \"figure\": \"figures/pacific-neuc-northern-reach-reference-path-candidate.svg\"\r\n}\r\n","source_sha256":"c4e7c44f1fd9aae231627828cc7881fbc6749a220a0a42fc488fe8000eb1b34c"},"research/pacific-neuc-southern-reach-reference-path-candidate.json":{"source_json":"{\r\n  \"schema\": \"osw.current-reference-path-input.v1\",\r\n  \"current_id\": \"pacific-north-equatorial-undercurrent\",\r\n  \"name\": \"Pacific NEUC - southern jet\",\r\n  \"status\": \"editorial_reference_path_candidate_not_scientifically_reviewed\",\r\n  \"geometry_role\": \"osw_editorial_reference_route\",\r\n  \"crs\": \"OGC:CRS84\",\r\n  \"scope\": \"Declared western-to-central southern NEUC component reach between OSW 135 E and 175 E gates. Near-western latitude context is 8 N; all connecting latitudes and bends are editorial. Excludes other NEUC components, 3 N SCC/Tsuchiya jet, western source paths and eastern continuation. Not a whole-component or parent-system length.\",\r\n  \"layer\": \"Argo P-vector absolute geostrophic zonal velocity on 27.0 sigma-theta (kg/m3), spatially varying depth. Not LICOM/SODA velocity, uniform depth, or the 3 N Tsuchiya jet.\",\r\n  \"time_convention\": \"2004-2014 Argo climatological mean, year precision; not a dated observed axis or monthly geometry. Model periods 1969-2007 are not transferred.\",\r\n  \"source_url\": \"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41598-018-35469-2\",\r\n  \"source_locator\": \"Li et al. (2018) complete JATS Results / Mean Structures of NEUCs: three Argo jets near 8/13/18 N at 130-135 E, tilting southwest-northeast. Figure 1(a) reviewed; Figure 2 samples 135-140 E and 175-180 E. Neither source curve nor velocity field digitized.\",\r\n  \"source_citation\": \"Li, Liu and Lin (2018), Interannual and decadal variability of the North Equatorial Undercurrents in an eddy-resolving ocean model, Scientific Reports 8, 17112, doi:10.1038/s41598-018-35469-2.\",\r\n  \"source_license\": \"CC BY 4.0 original article; attributed source facts and independent OSW geography. Existing licensed Figure 1 retained separately; no source curve digitization.\",\r\n  \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-13\",\r\n  \"coordinate_selection\": \"Source supports the declared regional geography or study-domain convention. OSW selects all gates, rounded connecting vertices and alternative bends; no velocity axis or source trajectory reconstructed. Independent longitude and endpoint-latitude shifts describe drawing choices, not current width, source position errors or seasonal extrema.\",\r\n  \"coordinates_lon_lat\": [\r\n    [\r\n      135,\r\n      8\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      145,\r\n      8.6\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      155,\r\n      9.2\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      165,\r\n      9.8\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      175,\r\n      10.5\r\n    ]\r\n  ],\r\n  \"alternative_routes\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"southern_bend\",\r\n      \"coordinates_lon_lat\": [\r\n        [\r\n          135,\r\n          8\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          145,\r\n          8.1\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          155,\r\n          8.7\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          165,\r\n          9.3\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          175,\r\n          10.5\r\n        ]\r\n      ],\r\n      \"interpretation\": \"Alternative editorial bend between the declared regional gates; not a measured seasonal state.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"northern_bend\",\r\n      \"coordinates_lon_lat\": [\r\n        [\r\n          135,\r\n          8\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          145,\r\n          9.1\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          155,\r\n          9.7\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          165,\r\n          10.3\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          175,\r\n          10.5\r\n        ]\r\n      ],\r\n      \"interpretation\": \"Alternative editorial bend between the declared regional gates; not a measured seasonal state.\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"longitude_offsets_degrees\": [\r\n    -0.25,\r\n    0,\r\n    0.25\r\n  ],\r\n  \"endpoint_latitude_offsets_degrees\": [\r\n    -0.5,\r\n    0,\r\n    0.5\r\n  ],\r\n  \"scenario_rule\": \"Three declared shapes with three longitude shifts and independent three-value endpoint latitude shifts: 81 retained editorial scenarios, not statistical uncertainty or annual variation.\",\r\n  \"report_rounding_km\": 100,\r\n  \"rank_eligible_published_estimates\": false,\r\n  \"candidate_comparison_group\": \"osw_studied_reach_routes\",\r\n  \"whole_system_length\": false,\r\n  \"remaining_gates\": [\r\n    \"Independently validate component/naming,layer,gates,fine coastline and bathymetry before physical admission.\",\r\n    \"Acquire compatible dated velocity geometry before measuring a current axis or seasonal dimensions.\",\r\n    \"Do not sum component reaches or transfer neighboring current/channel widths.\",\r\n    \"Whole-current dimensions,annual ranges,occupied width polygons,physical state containment and NASA identity remain unresolved.\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"map_view_box\": [\r\n    1330,\r\n    300,\r\n    210,\r\n    230\r\n  ],\r\n  \"map_label_size\": 2.6,\r\n  \"legend_line_spacing\": 4.16,\r\n  \"map_symbol_scale\": 0.65,\r\n  \"endpoint_labels\": [\r\n    \"135 E OSW gate\",\r\n    \"175 E OSW gate\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"figure_source_label\": \"Li et al. (2018), Argo Figure 1(a)\",\r\n  \"route_extent_kind\": \"southern NEUC isopycnal reference reach\",\r\n  \"source_component_id\": \"